-- חוזר לבעלויות תשע"ח/4: תשלום דמי הבראה ומענק יובל לשנת הלימודים תשע"ח
-- The recuperation allowance and the jubilee grant for school year
-- תשע"ח: the day rate and days table, the pro-rating, the employment caps,
-- the jubilee grant's entitlement and amount, and the June payment.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT property_checks

-- Time in the regulative rules is counted in school months of תשע"ח
-- (common.l4: September 2017 = 1, June 2018 = 10).

-- not weighed against `the Hours of Work and Rest Law`: the caps on the
-- position across all employers (140% off the reforms, 125% or 130% under Oz
-- LaTmura, 117% under Ofek Hadash, 150% for a principal) restate the
-- agreements' limits on employment beyond a full position. A cap takes away
-- no rest and adds no hour; the weeks the agreements allow beyond a full
-- position are weighed where they set them (the takanon's §1.24, the base
-- agreement's §33, the Oz agreement's §14).

-- not weighed against `the Equal Pay Law`: the words the search found are
-- not on its subject: ‘בעל’ is holding or having (‘בעל ותק’), not a
-- husband; ‘באב"ד’ is a name in the copies list; none gives pay or other
-- remuneration by sex.

§ `חוזר תשע"ח/4 הבראה ומענק יובל`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, date, reference, addressee, greeting and subject line; no rule.

DECLARE `tashach-4 circular action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the recuperation allowance in circular תשע"ח/4` HAS `recuperation paid` IS A NUMBER
    `pay the jubilee grant in circular תשע"ח/4` HAS `jubilee paid` IS A NUMBER
    `employ beyond the cap in circular תשע"ח/4` HAS `position employed` IS A NUMBER
    `work beyond the cap in circular תשע"ח/4` HAS `position worked` IS A NUMBER

§§ `1 קצובת דמי הבראה`

@desc A teaching employee's school year תשע"ח, as far as the recuperation allowance asks.
DECLARE `recuperation year of circular תשע"ח/4` HAS
    `seniority in teaching`   IS A NUMBER @desc the year of teaching seniority (the first year is 1)
    `positions`               IS A LIST OF `position with an employer`
    `months worked`           IS A NUMBER @desc months of work in the year

-- §1a: paid in full with the June 2018 salary.
@ref akn:art_1__para_a
GIVEN y IS A `recuperation year of circular תשע"ח/4`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tashach-4 circular action`
DECIDE `paying the recuperation allowance in full with the June 2018 salary` y IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the recuperation allowance in circular תשע"ח/4` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `recuperation allowance of circular תשע"ח/4` y
    WITHIN `month number` June
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "section 1a: the allowance is paid in full with the June 2018 salary"

-- §1b: 426 NIS a day.
@ref akn:art_1__para_b
`the recuperation day rate of circular תשע"ח/4` MEANS 426

-- §1c's table: recuperation days by seniority in teaching.
@ref akn:art_1__para_c akn:art_1__para_c/t1
`the recuperation days table of circular תשע"ח/4` MEANS
    LIST `recuperation band of circular תשע"ח/4` 1  3   7,
         `recuperation band of circular תשע"ח/4` 4  10  9,
         `recuperation band of circular תשע"ח/4` 11 15  10,
         `recuperation band of circular תשע"ח/4` 16 19  11,
         `recuperation band of circular תשע"ח/4` 20 24  12,
         `recuperation band of circular תשע"ח/4` 25 999 13

@desc A printed row of section 1c's table: years of teaching seniority and recuperation days.
DECLARE `recuperation band of circular תשע"ח/4` HAS
    `seniority from` IS A NUMBER
    `seniority to`   IS A NUMBER @desc 999 stands for "ומעלה"
    `days`           IS A NUMBER

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the days the table gives for year of circular תשע"ח/4` n IS
    map (GIVEN b YIELD b's `days`)
        (filter (GIVEN b YIELD n AT LEAST b's `seniority from` AND n AT MOST b's `seniority to`)
                `the recuperation days table of circular תשע"ח/4`)

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `recuperation days` n IS sum (`the days the table gives for year of circular תשע"ח/4` n)

-- Every year of seniority from 1 to 40 falls in exactly one band.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN n YIELD count (`the days the table gives for year of circular תשע"ח/4` n) EQUALS 1) (range 1 40)

GIVEN y IS A `recuperation year of circular תשע"ח/4`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `full recuperation allowance` y IS
    `the recuperation day rate of circular תשע"ח/4` TIMES `recuperation days` (y's `seniority in teaching`)

-- §1d: a part-time employee gets the allowance in proportion to the
-- position held that year, "1/10 for each month of work". The parenthesis
-- is read as pro-rating by the months worked, a full year being ten months
-- of work and never more (F-2017-18_tashach_04-a).
@ref akn:art_1__para_d
GIVEN y IS A `recuperation year of circular תשע"ח/4`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `months share of circular תשע"ח/4` y IS
    min (y's `months worked` DIVIDED BY 10) 1

-- §1e: above a full position, the allowance of one full position only.
@ref akn:art_1__para_e
GIVEN y IS A `recuperation year of circular תשע"ח/4`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `position share` y IS
    min (`total position` y) 1

GIVEN y IS A `recuperation year of circular תשע"ח/4`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `total position` y IS
    sum (map (GIVEN p YIELD p's `position fraction with the employer`) (y's `positions`))

@export default The recuperation allowance a teaching employee is owed for school year 5778 (2017-18) under the owners' circular 5778/4
@ref akn:art_1__para_d akn:art_1__para_e
GIVEN y IS A `recuperation year of circular תשע"ח/4` @desc the employee's school year
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `recuperation allowance of circular תשע"ח/4` y IS
    `full recuperation allowance` y TIMES `position share` y TIMES `months share of circular תשע"ח/4` y

-- §1f: with more than one employer and above 100% in all, each employer
-- pays the allowance proportional to the position with it. The reading
-- adopted (F-2017-18_tashach_04-b): §1f governs several employers, §1e one.
@ref akn:art_1__para_f
GIVEN y IS A `recuperation year of circular תשע"ח/4`, p IS A `position with an employer`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the allowance one employer pays of circular תשע"ח/4` y p IS
    IF count (y's `positions`) GREATER THAN 1 AND `total position` y GREATER THAN 1
    THEN `full recuperation allowance` y TIMES p's `position fraction with the employer` TIMES `months share of circular תשע"ח/4` y
    ELSE `recuperation allowance of circular תשע"ח/4` y

-- §1g-§1h: the caps on employment across all employers: 140% for a teacher
-- and 150% for a principal not under the reform, 125% under Oz LeTmura in
-- full implementation, 117% under Ofek Hadash.
@ref akn:art_1__para_g akn:art_1__para_h
GIVEN t IS AN `employment track`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the employment cap of circular תשע"ח/4` t IS
    CONSIDER t
    WHEN `a teacher outside the reforms`   THEN 1.40
    WHEN `a principal outside the reforms` THEN 1.50
    WHEN `a teacher in Oz LaTmura in full implementation` THEN 1.25
    WHEN `a teacher in Ofek Hadash`      THEN 1.17

-- The restriction on the teacher's work (§1g), with no time limit; the
-- exception is ¶3's, an approval under the exceptional-employment procedure.
GIVEN t IS AN `employment track`, `approved under the exceptional-employment procedure` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tashach-4 circular action`
DECIDE `the teacher does not work beyond the cap unless approved` t `approved under the exceptional-employment procedure` IS
    IF `approved under the exceptional-employment procedure`
    THEN FULFILLED
    ELSE PARTY `the teaching employee`
         SHANT `work beyond the cap in circular תשע"ח/4` `position`
               PROVIDED `position` GREATER THAN `the employment cap of circular תשע"ח/4` t
         LEST BREACH BY `the teaching employee` BECAUSE "section 1g: a teacher is restricted from working beyond the cap across all employers"

-- §1h ¶3-¶6: subject to the exceptional-employment procedure for תשע"ח (a
-- link); none of it permits employment beyond the caps.
@ref akn:art_1__para_h/p2 akn:art_1__para_h/p3 akn:art_1__para_h/p4
GIVEN t IS AN `employment track`, `approved under the exceptional-employment procedure` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tashach-4 circular action`
DECIDE `no employment beyond the cap unless approved of circular תשע"ח/4` t `approved under the exceptional-employment procedure` IS
    IF `approved under the exceptional-employment procedure`
    THEN FULFILLED
    ELSE PARTY `the employer`
         SHANT `employ beyond the cap in circular תשע"ח/4` `position`
               PROVIDED `position` GREATER THAN `the employment cap of circular תשע"ח/4` t
         LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "sections 1g-1h: employment beyond the cap across all employers"

§§ `2 מענק יובל`

@desc One part of the employee's position, by stage of education.
DECLARE `jubilee position` HAS
    `stage` IS A `stage of education`
    `fraction of the position` IS A NUMBER

@desc A teaching employee's school year תשע"ח, as far as the jubilee grant asks.
DECLARE `jubilee year` HAS
    `seniority set in September 2017` IS A NUMBER @desc cumulative teaching seniority incl. military service, as set in September of the year before the grant (section 2d)
    `years of work completed by 1 June 2018` IS A NUMBER @desc accumulated teaching seniority incl. military service, completed by 1 June 2018: section 2b's measure, which section 2e(2)'s "years of work in Israel" are read as (F-2017-18_tashach_04-d)
    `years of unpaid leave with pension rights bought` IS A NUMBER @desc counted towards seniority (section 2e(1)); assumed not already in the two counts above
    `jubilee positions` IS A LIST OF `jubilee position`
    `share of the year employed` IS A NUMBER @desc 1 = the whole year
    `determining salary for pension and severance` IS A NUMBER @desc monthly, excluding once-a-year payments such as clothing and recuperation

-- §2a: paid with the June 2018 salary.
@ref akn:art_2__para_a
GIVEN j IS A `jubilee year`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tashach-4 circular action`
DECIDE `paying the jubilee grant of circular תשע"ח/4` j IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the jubilee grant in circular תשע"ח/4` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `jubilee grant` j
    WITHIN `month number` June
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "section 2a: the jubilee grant is paid with the June 2018 salary"

-- §2b, §2e(3): 25 years for the part of the position in a middle or upper
-- division, 30 for the part elsewhere: of the shared `stage of education`,
-- the junior-high and upper-division stages are 25 and every other — the
-- kindergarten, the primary school and the teachers' college §2b names —
-- is 30.
@ref akn:art_2__para_b akn:art_2__para_e__subpara_3
GIVEN s IS A `stage of education`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the jubilee threshold of circular תשע"ח/4` s IS
    CONSIDER s
    WHEN `the junior-high stage` THEN 25
    WHEN `the upper-division stage` THEN 25
    OTHERWISE 30

-- §2e(1): a year of unpaid leave for which pension rights were bought counts.
@ref akn:art_2__para_e__subpara_1
GIVEN j IS A `jubilee year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `seniority for the jubilee grant` j IS
    j's `seniority set in September 2017` PLUS j's `years of unpaid leave with pension rights bought`

-- §2d against §2e(2): the reading adopted (F-2017-18_tashach_04-c) is §2e(2),
-- the years completed by 1 June of the grant's year.
@ref akn:art_2__para_d akn:art_2__para_e__subpara_2
GIVEN j IS A `jubilee year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `seniority counted for the grant of circular תשע"ח/4` j IS
    j's `years of work completed by 1 June 2018` PLUS j's `years of unpaid leave with pension rights bought`

-- §2e(2): the grant is earned in the year the qualifying seniority is
-- completed by 1 June. F-2017-18_tashach_04-e: §2b's "ומעלה" is read in the
-- light of this clause, as every jubilee circular's same words are read:
-- the grant is paid once, in the year of completion.
GIVEN j IS A `jubilee year`, p IS A `jubilee position`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the position part qualifies` j p IF
    `seniority counted for the grant of circular תשע"ח/4` j EQUALS `the jubilee threshold of circular תשע"ח/4` (p's `stage`)

-- F-2017-18_tashach_04-d: 2ב counts accumulated seniority in teaching, military
-- service included, with the employers, the owners and in formal
-- education; 2ה(2) counts "years of work in Israel", compulsory IDF service
-- included. The reading adopted, as in every jubilee circular: 2ב's own
-- measure, which 2ה(3) calls accumulated seniority "כהגדרתו לעיל"; 2ה(2)'s
-- years are read as that seniority, completed by 1 June.
GIVEN `years in teaching` IS A NUMBER, s IS A `stage of education`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `has the years 2ב counts in circular תשע"ח/4` `years in teaching` s IF
    `years in teaching` AT LEAST `the jubilee threshold of circular תשע"ח/4` s

GIVEN `years in teaching` IS A NUMBER, `years of other work in Israel` IS A NUMBER, s IS A `stage of education`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `has the years 2ה(2) counts in circular תשע"ח/4` `years in teaching` `years of other work in Israel` s IF
    `years in teaching` PLUS `years of other work in Israel` AT LEAST `the jubilee threshold of circular תשע"ח/4` s

`2ב and 2ה(2) count different years in circular תשע"ח/4` MEANS
        `has the years 2ה(2) counts in circular תשע"ח/4` 20 10 `the primary stage`
    AND (NOT `has the years 2ב counts in circular תשע"ח/4` 20 `the primary stage`)
#ASSERT `2ב and 2ה(2) count different years in circular תשע"ח/4`

-- not weighed against `the Severance Pay Law`: The circular names the
-- determining salary for pension and severance only as the base of the
-- jubilee grant's 60%; it rules nothing on severance.

-- §2c: 60% of the determining salary.
@ref akn:art_2__para_c
`the jubilee rate of circular תשע"ח/4` MEANS 0.6

-- §2e(4): by the position that year, up to one position, and the period
-- employed.
@ref akn:art_2__para_e__subpara_4
GIVEN j IS A `jubilee year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `qualifying jubilee position` j IS
    min (sum (map (GIVEN p YIELD p's `fraction of the position`)
                  (filter (GIVEN p YIELD `the position part qualifies` j p) (j's `jubilee positions`)))) 1

@export The jubilee grant (maanak yovel) a teaching employee is owed for school year 5778 under the owners' circular 5778/4
@ref akn:art_2__para_b akn:art_2__para_c akn:art_2__para_e__subpara_4
GIVEN j IS A `jubilee year` @desc the employee's school year
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `jubilee grant` j IS
    `the jubilee rate of circular תשע"ח/4`
    TIMES j's `determining salary for pension and severance`
    TIMES `qualifying jubilee position` j
    TIMES j's `share of the year employed`

-- §2e(5): with more than one employer, §§1f-1h apply with the changes
-- needed: each employer pays in proportion to the position with it.
@ref akn:art_2__para_e__subpara_5
GIVEN j IS A `jubilee year`, `fraction with this employer` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the jubilee grant one employer pays of circular תשע"ח/4` j `fraction with this employer` IS
    `the jubilee rate of circular תשע"ח/4`
    TIMES j's `determining salary for pension and severance`
    TIMES `fraction with this employer`
    TIMES j's `share of the year employed`

-- akn:art_2__para_e/p1 The heading "הבהרות" (clarifications); no rule.

-- akn:conclusions The contact line, the sign-off and the copies list; no rule.

§§ `Findings`

-- F-2017-18_tashach_04-a: "1/10 for each month of work" gives a full year
-- of twelve months 12/10 of the allowance if read literally.
`a twelve-month year read literally` MEANS 12 TIMES (1 DIVIDED BY 10)
`one tenth a month passes the full allowance in a twelve-month year` MEANS
    `a twelve-month year read literally` GREATER THAN 1
#ASSERT `one tenth a month passes the full allowance in a twelve-month year`

-- F-2017-18_tashach_04-b: 80% with one employer and 60% with another.
`a teacher with two employers of circular תשע"ח/4` MEANS `recuperation year of circular תשע"ח/4` WITH
    `seniority in teaching` IS 12
    `positions`             IS LIST `position with an employer` 0.8, `position with an employer` 0.6
    `months worked`         IS 10

`the two employers pay more than one full allowance in circular תשע"ח/4` MEANS
    sum (map (GIVEN p YIELD `the allowance one employer pays of circular תשע"ח/4` `a teacher with two employers of circular תשע"ח/4` p) (`a teacher with two employers of circular תשע"ח/4`'s `positions`))
    GREATER THAN `recuperation allowance of circular תשע"ח/4` `a teacher with two employers of circular תשע"ח/4`
#ASSERT `the two employers pay more than one full allowance in circular תשע"ח/4`

-- F-2017-18_tashach_04-c: seniority 24 as set in September 2017, 25 years
-- completed by 1 June 2018.
`a teacher reaching 25 in the spring of circular תשע"ח/4` MEANS `jubilee year` WITH
    `seniority set in September 2017`               IS 24
    `years of work completed by 1 June 2018`        IS 25
    `years of unpaid leave with pension rights bought` IS 0
    `jubilee positions`                             IS LIST `jubilee position` `the upper-division stage` 1
    `share of the year employed`                    IS 1
    `determining salary for pension and severance`  IS 10000

`section 2d and section 2e(2) decide the spring case differently` MEANS
        `seniority for the jubilee grant` `a teacher reaching 25 in the spring of circular תשע"ח/4` LESS THAN 25
    AND `seniority counted for the grant of circular תשע"ח/4` `a teacher reaching 25 in the spring of circular תשע"ח/4` AT LEAST 25
#ASSERT `section 2d and section 2e(2) decide the spring case differently`

-- F-2017-18_tashach_04-e: §2b grants "25 או 30 שנה ומעלה" (25 or 30 and
-- above); §2e(2) grants it in the year the seniority is completed. For 28
-- years in an upper division the two differ.
GIVEN j IS A `jubilee year`, p IS A `jubilee position`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the position part qualifies on "and above"` j p IF
    `seniority counted for the grant of circular תשע"ח/4` j AT LEAST `the jubilee threshold of circular תשע"ח/4` (p's `stage`)

`an upper-division teacher with 28 years of circular תשע"ח/4` MEANS `jubilee year` WITH
    `seniority set in September 2017`               IS 27
    `years of work completed by 1 June 2018`        IS 28
    `years of unpaid leave with pension rights bought` IS 0
    `jubilee positions`                             IS LIST `jubilee position` `the upper-division stage` 1
    `share of the year employed`                    IS 1
    `determining salary for pension and severance`  IS 10000

`"and above" and the year of completion differ for 28 years in circular תשע"ח/4` MEANS
        `the position part qualifies on "and above"` `an upper-division teacher with 28 years of circular תשע"ח/4` (`jubilee position` `the upper-division stage` 1)
    AND NOT `the position part qualifies` `an upper-division teacher with 28 years of circular תשע"ח/4` (`jubilee position` `the upper-division stage` 1)
#ASSERT `"and above" and the year of completion differ for 28 years in circular תשע"ח/4`

§§ `Worked examples`

-- The salary of 10,000 is a placeholder.
#ASSERT `recuperation days` 3 EQUALS 7
#ASSERT `recuperation days` 25 EQUALS 13
#ASSERT `recuperation allowance of circular תשע"ח/4` `a teacher with two employers of circular תשע"ח/4` EQUALS 4260
#ASSERT `jubilee grant` `a teacher reaching 25 in the spring of circular תשע"ח/4` EQUALS 6000

`a primary and upper-division teacher of 25 years of circular תשע"ח/4` MEANS `jubilee year` WITH
    `seniority set in September 2017`               IS 24
    `years of work completed by 1 June 2018`        IS 25
    `years of unpaid leave with pension rights bought` IS 0
    `jubilee positions`                             IS LIST `jubilee position` `the upper-division stage` 0.5, `jubilee position` `the primary stage` 0.5
    `share of the year employed`                    IS 1
    `determining salary for pension and severance`  IS 10000
#ASSERT `jubilee grant` `a primary and upper-division teacher of 25 years of circular תשע"ח/4` EQUALS 3000
#ASSERT `jubilee grant` `an upper-division teacher with 28 years of circular תשע"ח/4` EQUALS 0

#TRACE `paying the recuperation allowance in full with the June 2018 salary` `a teacher with two employers of circular תשע"ח/4` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the recuperation allowance in circular תשע"ח/4` 4260 AT 10
#TRACE `no employment beyond the cap unless approved of circular תשע"ח/4` `a teacher in Ofek Hadash` FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `employ beyond the cap in circular תשע"ח/4` 1.2 AT 1

§§ `Property checks`

-- The circular over a finite space: years of seniority 1 to 60; one or two
-- employers at positions in tenths from 0 to 1.5; 0 to 12 months worked;
-- every employment track and approval; years of seniority 1 to 45 with a
-- position split between any two stages in either order.

`every track` MEANS
    LIST `a teacher outside the reforms`, `a principal outside the reforms`,
         `a teacher in Oz LaTmura in full implementation`, `a teacher in Ofek Hadash`
`both stages` MEANS `every stage of education`

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER, p IS A NUMBER, q IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `recuperation year of circular תשע"ח/4`
DECIDE `a checked year of circular תשע"ח/4` n p q m IS
    `recuperation year of circular תשע"ח/4` WITH
        `seniority in teaching` IS n
        `positions`             IS LIST `position with an employer` p, `position with an employer` q
        `months worked`         IS m

-- §1c: every year from 1 to 60 is in exactly one row, and the days never
-- fall with seniority.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN n YIELD
                    count (`the days the table gives for year of circular תשע"ח/4` n) EQUALS 1
                AND `recuperation days` n AT MOST `recuperation days` (n PLUS 1))
            (range 1 60)

-- §1b-§1f over seniority, two positions and 0 to 12 months: the allowance is never
-- negative, never more than a full position's days, never falls with
-- another month, a larger position or another year; above a full position
-- in all, each employer's share adds up to the positions (finding b's
-- reading), and at most one employer's whole allowance otherwise.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN n YIELD
                all (GIVEN p YIELD
                        all (GIVEN q YIELD
                                all (GIVEN m YIELD
                                        LET y MEANS `a checked year of circular תשע"ח/4` n p q m
                                            a MEANS `recuperation allowance of circular תשע"ח/4` y
                                        IN      a AT LEAST 0
                                            AND a AT MOST `full recuperation allowance` y
                                            AND a AT MOST `recuperation allowance of circular תשע"ח/4` (`a checked year of circular תשע"ח/4` n p q (m PLUS 1))
                                            AND a AT MOST `recuperation allowance of circular תשע"ח/4` (`a checked year of circular תשע"ח/4` n (p PLUS 0.1) q m)
                                            AND a AT MOST `recuperation allowance of circular תשע"ח/4` (`a checked year of circular תשע"ח/4` (n PLUS 1) p q m)
                                            AND (   p PLUS q AT MOST 1
                                                 OR sum (map (GIVEN e YIELD `the allowance one employer pays of circular תשע"ח/4` y e) (y's `positions`))
                                                    EQUALS `full recuperation allowance` y TIMES (p PLUS q) TIMES `months share of circular תשע"ח/4` y))
                                    (range 0 12))
                            (LIST 0, 0.3, 0.5, 0.8))
                    `tenths to 1.5`)
            (LIST 1, 3, 4, 10, 11, 25, 40)

-- §§1g-1h over every track: each cap lies between Ofek Hadash's 117% and
-- the non-reform principal's 150%.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN t YIELD
                    `the employment cap of circular תשע"ח/4` t AT LEAST 1.17
                AND `the employment cap of circular תשע"ח/4` t AT MOST 1.5)
            `every track`

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, s IS A `stage of education`, u IS A `stage of education`
GIVETH A `jubilee year`
DECIDE `a checked jubilee year of circular תשע"ח/4` y s u IS
    `jubilee year` WITH
        `seniority set in September 2017`               IS y MINUS 1
        `years of work completed by 1 June 2018`        IS y MINUS 1
        `years of unpaid leave with pension rights bought` IS 1
        `jubilee positions`                             IS LIST `jubilee position` s 0.6, `jubilee position` u 0.4
        `share of the year employed`                    IS 1
        `determining salary for pension and severance`  IS 10000

-- §2 over both stages in either order and seniority 1 to 45: a part
-- qualifies exactly in the year its stage's threshold is completed, so over
-- a career each part qualifies once (finding e's reading); the grant is
-- never negative, never more than 60% of the salary, and 60% of it times
-- the qualifying parts.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN s YIELD
                all (GIVEN u YIELD
                            count (filter (GIVEN y YIELD `the position part qualifies` (`a checked jubilee year of circular תשע"ח/4` y s u) (`jubilee position` s 0.6)) (range 1 45))
                            EQUALS 1
                        AND all (GIVEN y YIELD
                                    LET j MEANS `a checked jubilee year of circular תשע"ח/4` y s u
                                        g MEANS `jubilee grant` j
                                    IN      g AT LEAST 0
                                        AND g AT MOST 6000
                                        AND g EQUALS 6000 TIMES ((IF y EQUALS `the jubilee threshold of circular תשע"ח/4` s THEN 0.6 ELSE 0)
                                                                 PLUS (IF y EQUALS `the jubilee threshold of circular תשע"ח/4` u THEN 0.4 ELSE 0)))
                                (range 1 45))
                    `both stages`)
            `both stages`

-- §2e(5) over one employer's fraction in tenths: what it pays is 60% of
-- the salary times that fraction.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN f YIELD
                `the jubilee grant one employer pays of circular תשע"ח/4` (`a checked jubilee year of circular תשע"ח/4` 25 `the upper-division stage` `the upper-division stage`) f
                EQUALS 6000 TIMES f)
            `tenths to 1.5`

-- F-2017-18_tashach_04-f: the limits clause gives a principal outside the reform
-- 150%, and the closing restatement lists 140% "without reform" with no
-- principal's figure. Reading adopted, as in F-2021-22_tashpab_06-b: the
-- limits clause governs, and the restatement repeats the teachers' limits;
-- the encoding above gives the principal 150%.
`the principal's limit in the limits clause` MEANS 1.5
`the limit the restatement gives one outside the reforms` MEANS 1.4
`the limits clause and its restatement give a principal outside the reforms different limits` MEANS
    NOT (`the principal's limit in the limits clause` EQUALS `the limit the restatement gives one outside the reforms`)
#ASSERT `the limits clause and its restatement give a principal outside the reforms different limits`

-- F-2017-18_tashach_04-g: §2ה(4) pays the jubilee grant "up to one position only";
-- §2ה(5) applies §§1ו-1ח to an employee of several employers, and §1ו has
-- each employer pay the share held with it. Reading adopted, as in
-- F-2020-21_tashpa_07-d: each employer pays its share, and the one-position
-- cap is at each employer, as the grant one employer pays is encoded above.
`the jubilee shares §1ו gives for 80% and 60%` MEANS LIST 0.8, 0.6
`the jubilee's one-position cap and §2ה(5) disagree for two employers` MEANS
    sum `the jubilee shares §1ו gives for 80% and 60%` GREATER THAN 1
#ASSERT `the jubilee's one-position cap and §2ה(5) disagree for two employers`
